{"id":647,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教精神と知性を育む女子教育","feature_description":"キリスト教精神と知性を育む女子教育を教育の核に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":12005,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12006,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12007,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12008,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12009,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12010,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12011,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12012,"name":"化学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12013,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12014,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12015,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12016,"name":"新聞部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12017,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12018,"name":"地学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://shizuoka-futaba.ac.jp/club/","